      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Complex 1 is an SMM with SMT/toroidal moment. χMT at room temperature is 86.37 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 85.02 for six free Dy(III)), falling to 21.03 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K, indicating weaker coupling than parent Dy6-2. Magnetization at 1.9 K shows an S-shaped SMT-like curve with inflection near 12 kOe and Mmax = 33.83 μB at ~45 kOe (vs 60 μB saturation). Zero-field ac χ″ has a broad peak at 7 K and low-T upturns from QTM. Magellan electrostatic axes support toroidal moments in both Dy3 units.",
